  <NAME>Transcriptome analysis to UHRF1 depletion in RaeL cells</NAME>
  <TITLE>Transcriptome analysis to UHRF1 depletion in RaeL cells</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>RNAseq was used to identify host and viral transcriptome changes in UHRF1 knock-out RaeL cells. UHRF1 KO RaeL cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The RaeL cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control. Overall design: UHRF1 KO RaeL cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The RaeL cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.</DESCRIPTION>
